---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software and models
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
The files in this repository contain NO third-party source code. The optional "AI boost"
engine loads the following components at run time from public CDNs / model hubs only if
the user explicitly enables it. They are NOT redistributed here and keep their own licences:

  * Transformers.js (@huggingface/transformers)  - Apache License 2.0
      https://github.com/huggingface/transformers.js
  * ONNX Runtime Web (loaded by Transformers.js)  - MIT License
      https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
  * SegFormer-B0 fine-tuned on ADE20K (ONNX conversion Xenova/segformer-b0-finetuned-ade-512-512,
    original nvidia/segformer-b0-finetuned-ade-512-512) - NVIDIA licence ("other" on the model card;
    the SegFormer code is under the NVIDIA Source Code License, intended for research / evaluation use).
      https://huggingface.co/nvidia/segformer-b0-finetuned-ade-512-512
      https://github.com/NVlabs/SegFormer

The exclusion of rights above applies to the original work of egoaid only and does not
restrict or replace the licences of the third-party components listed in this section.

The colour presets are original palettes created for this project; the project is not
affiliated with, or endorsed by, any artist or record label.
